=3D"margin: 0; outline: none; padding: 0; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">Th=
e whole point of this Pre-Dispute Process is to remove the Address ID Code =
from the personal information section, so that it's less likely the compute=
rs will find a match with a derogatory account and automatically verify. Wh=
en disputing the address, only list the physical address not the Address Id=
entification Number. Remember, the removal of an address doesn't equate to =
an automatic removal of an account, although that may occur. What you're wa=
nting to do is make it harder for the bureaus to verify so that they are ei=
ther forced to conduct a proper investigation as outlined in <span style=3D=
"color: #ff0000; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inh=
erit; text-decoration: inherit;" class=3D"">their</span> procedures or dele=
te the disputed account.</b></div>=0A <br></div>=0A </div>=0A</td>=0A</tr>=
